Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.14 25/35] net: hns: Use NAPI_POLL_WEIGHT for hns driver
Date:   Wed, 24 Apr 2019 10:46:59 -0400
Message-Id: <20190424144709.30215-25-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.1
In-Reply-To: <20190424144709.30215-1-sashal@kernel.org>
